 "remarks": "Move right into this gut renovated townhouse condo in Whitney Glen, a sought after community in Westport. Thoughtfully updated throughout, this sun filled home features a renovated kitchen, brand new bathrooms, and new flooring. The bright, open living room boasts soaring ceilings, a wood burning fireplace, and sliding glass doors leading to a private, covered deck, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The main level also offers a spacious bedroom with sliders to another private deck and a beautifully renovated full bath. Upstairs, the primary suite features its own outdoor deck, a dressing room, and a brand new bathroom. An additional loft provides flexible space for a home office, reading nook, or overnight guests. A convenient laundry room is complemented by an extra large walk in closet for exceptional storage. The fully finished lower level offers even more versatility, ideal for a recreation room, home office, hobby space, or additional storage. Enjoy one assigned parking space, ample visitor parking, and easy access to the complex's heated saltwater pool. Experience comfortable, low maintenance living in a desirable Westport location where you can stroll to shopping, downtown restaurants and Westport town park. One resident must be 62 years of age or older.",
